{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1400356-playtesters-needed-sidereal-book-rewrite","id":1400356,"title":"Playtesters needed: Sidereal book rewrite!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Sidereal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-01T11:12:35-07:00","id":1400356,"title":"Playtesters needed: Sidereal book rewrite!","content":"I am one of the two writers responsible for the <b>Manual of Exalted Power - Eternals</b> and for my next project I have decided to rewrite all of the Sidereal Charms and Astrology rules. I have completed my first draft, and am looking to host an online game to test the system out. My cowriter on the last book, Korekore, will be one player, so I'm looking for 3-4 other players who could also play once every other week. I'd like some players that are new to Exalted, if possible, to see how easy the new rules are to understand and enjoy. Anyone who participates will get a playtesting credit when I publish the book to the Storyteller's Vault, though I will require everyone to sign NDA agreements before sending you the book so that I can protect my intellectual property.<br /> <br /> The story will be an isekai (waking up in another world trope), with players making modern day characters that become Sidereals and then have to split their adventures between Creation, Yu-Shan and what you call the &quot;real world.&quot; I'm going with this angle to make the game easier to get into for new players, since your characters won't know much about Creation either. I've been playing and running Exalted for over a decade now, and have been running other systems for much longer, so my main objective here is just to have fun with the product that I made with others. Hopefully that will also produce some good edits for the book. I'd like to record and post these games to help advertise the book when it comes out, assuming of course that the group jives well and everyone has fun with it.<br /> <br /> Would anyone be interested in joining this game? I can host it via Discord, Roll 20, Tabletop Simulator, or just about any other virtual format. No video will be required. My schedule is wide open at the moment, but Fridays through Sundays typically work best for most people in my experience.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1318-kindledradial","name":"kindledRadial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1318_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T15:11:06-07:00","id":1400403,"title":"","content":"Is it Play By Post?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T20:09:58-07:00","id":1400448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1400356-playtesters-needed-sidereal-book-rewrite?p=1400403#post1400403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it Play By Post?</div> </div> </div> </div>It will be voice chat, though I'm flexible on what platform works for people. Basically we'd all pick a day and time that works for everyone and join the same voice chat room. A set of headphones/mic would be a must, btw, to avoid the echo chamber effect you get from a mic picking up speaker sound.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1318-kindledradial","name":"kindledRadial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1318_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T04:01:24-07:00","id":1400689,"title":"","content":"Dang it. I want in. So bad. And my schedule is too hectic for a live game right now. Maybe I can clear my plate if I push hard.<br /> <br /> This is very cleaver way to build up interest, BTW.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-03T11:47:06-07:00","id":1400795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/sidereal-exalted/1400356-playtesters-needed-sidereal-book-rewrite?p=1400689#post1400689\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Dang it. I want in. So bad. And my schedule is too hectic for a live game right now. Maybe I can clear my plate if I push hard.</div> </div> </div> </div>So far I have one person from here who wants in so let me know if your schedule clears, we might still have space! Currently looking for two more players, still want someone with littler to no Exalted experience, if possible.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1318-kindledradial","name":"kindledRadial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1318_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-10T18:38:22-07:00","id":1402160,"title":"","content":"Quick update: I now have a Chosen of Battles, Serenity, Endings, and a Secrets who will have to join after the first session. Currently looking for a fourth for the first session. This does NOT have to be a Harbinger, but it would be great if only so that I could test their Caste Charms a bit. Is anyone else interested/free?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1318-kindledradial","name":"kindledRadial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1318_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}